      "suggestedVersionCode": "1",
      "description": "Paisa keeps your money ledger on your phone.\n\nBank SMS is parsed on-device (100+ Indian banks via an AGPL parser\ncore). Optional BYOK statement import for PDF/CSV/images \u2014 your API\nkey, your endpoint; SMS never leaves the device.\n\nFeatures:\n* Home balance, filters, and recent transactions\n* Analytics charts with date ranges\n* Monthly budgets by category\n* Multiple accounts / wallets\n* SMS bulk scan + live receiver with hash dedup\n* App lock via biometrics or device credential\n* Export to CSV / PDF\n\nPackage ID: codes.tashif.paisa\n",
      "issueTracker": "https://github.com/tashifkhan/Paisa/issues",
